If you want to see these authentication concepts applied in a more robust manner, you can see them in action in this [demo app](https://github.com/aacsearch/getting-started-projects/tree/main/svelte/auth).

## Other authentication methods {% #other-authentication-methods %}
AACSearch also supports OAuth, passwordless login, anonymous login, and phone login. 
Learn more about them in the [authentication guide](https://aacsearch.io/docs/products/auth).
